adjointFactorization -- Constructs matrix factorization of a determinant of a matrix
************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        adjointFactorization M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, A square matrix
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, The matrix
        factorization of the determinant of M determined by the adjoint matrix

Description
===========

Given a matrix $M$, the adjoint matrix $M'$ is the matrix satisfying $M \cdot
M' = M' \cdot M = \det(M) id$. This means that any square matrix induces a
matrix factorization of its determinant, and this function implements this
induced matrix factorization.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[x_(1,1)..x_(3,3)]                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = genericMatrix(Q,3,3)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = | x_(1,1) x_(2,1) x_(3,1) |                                             |
|     | x_(1,2) x_(2,2) x_(3,2) |                                             |
|     | x_(1,3) x_(2,3) x_(3,3) |                                             |
|                                                                             |
|             3      3                                                        |
|o2 : Matrix Q  <-- Q                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : F = adjointFactorization M                                              |
|                                                                             |
|      3      3      3                                                        |
|o3 = Q  <-- Q  <-- Q                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F.dd                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                                                  |
|o4 = 1 : Q  <----------------------------------------------------------------|
|               {1} | -x_(2,3)x_(3,2)+x_(2,2)x_(3,3) x_(2,3)x_(3,1)-x_(2,1)x_(|
|               {1} | x_(1,3)x_(3,2)-x_(1,2)x_(3,3)  -x_(1,3)x_(3,1)+x_(1,1)x_|
|               {1} | -x_(1,3)x_(2,2)+x_(1,2)x_(2,3) x_(1,3)x_(2,1)-x_(1,1)x_(|
|                                                                             |
|          3                                       3                          |
|     0 : Q  <----------------------------------- Q  : 1                      |
|               {2} | x_(1,1) x_(2,1) x_(3,1) |                               |
|               {2} | x_(1,2) x_(2,2) x_(3,2) |                               |
|               {2} | x_(1,3) x_(2,3) x_(3,3) |                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                          3                                  |
|---------------------------------------- Q  : 0                              |
|3,3)  -x_(2,2)x_(3,1)+x_(2,1)x_(3,2) |                                       |
|(3,3) x_(1,2)x_(3,1)-x_(1,1)x_(3,2)  |                                       |
|2,3)  -x_(1,2)x_(2,1)+x_(1,1)x_(2,2) |                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : potential F == determinant M                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

