coimage(ZZdFactorizationMap) -- make the coimage of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
***************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note coimage: (Macaulay2Doc)coimage,
  * Usage: 
        coimage f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 

Description
===========

The coimage of a ZZ/d-graded factorization map $f : C \to D$ is the ZZ/d-graded
factorization $E$ whose $i-th$ term is $coimage(f_i)$, and whose differential
is induced from the differential on the source.

