|                                                                             |
|o3 = ideal (a, b)                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : use S;                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
