|                                                                             |
|      2      2      2                                                        |
|o5 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : D = tailMF (m^2)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|      3      3      3                                                        |
|o6 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : f = randomFactorizationMap(D, C, Cycle => true, InternalDegree => 2)    |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                      2                           |
|o7 = 0 : S  <---------------------------------- S  : 0                       |
|               {3} | 20a+29b 24a2-17ab+9b2  |                                |
|               {3} | 10a-19b 30a2-48ab-7b2  |                                |
|               {3} | 32a-36b 19a2-11ab-21b2 |                                |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                2                                 |
