ComplexMap ** ZZdFactorizationMap -- the map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations between tensor factorizations, obtained by first folding the relevant complex map
************************************************************************************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        h = f ** g
        h = tensor(f, g)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of complexes: (Complexes)ComplexMap,, or a *note map of
        ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,
      * g, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, or
        a *note map of complexes: (Complexes)ComplexMap,
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 

Description
===========

The maps $f : C \to D$ and $g : E \to F$ of ZZ/d-graded factorizations induce
the map $h = f \otimes g : C \otimes E \to D \otimes F$ defined by $c \otimes e
\mapsto f(c) \otimes g(e)$.

