|                                                           |
|     0      1      0                                       |
|                                                           |
|o9 : ZZdFactorization                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : f' = randomFactorizationMap(D, D')                   |
|                                                           |
|           3                                          3    |
|o10 = 0 : S  <-------------------------------------- S  : 0|
|                {3} | -13a-43b 2a+16b   -47a+47b |         |
|                {3} | -15a-28b 22a+45b  19a-16b  |         |
|                {3} | -47a+38b -34a-48b 7a+15b   |         |
|                                                           |
|           3                                        3      |
|      1 : S  <------------------------------------ S  : 1  |
