        h = dual(f,t)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
      * t, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, optional input
        specifying the symbol used to represent the distinguished root of
        unity, required only if the underlying ring does not have a specified
        root of unity and the period is > 2
