eulerMF -- Construct a Koszul matrix factorization with respect to the Jacobian ideal
*************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        eulerMF(RingElement)
  * Inputs:
      * RingElement, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, A
        polynomial element
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 

Description
===========

Constructs a Koszul matrix factorization with respect to the Jacobian ideal.
This method works best in characteristic 0. This method utilizes the \(
\text{koszulMF} \) function to construct a Koszul matrix factorization with
respect to the Jacobian ideal of the polynomial \( f \).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x,y,z];                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x^2*y - y^3;                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = eulerMF(f)                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|      2      2      2                                                        |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : K.dd                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|          2                       2                                          |
|o4 = 1 : R  <------------------- R  : 0                                      |
|               | 34y 2xy     |                                               |
|               | 34x -x2+3y2 |                                               |
|                                                                             |
|          2                       2                                          |
|     0 : R  <------------------- R  : 1                                      |
|               | x2-3y2 2xy  |                                               |
|               | 34x    -34y |                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g = random(4,R)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|        4      3       2 2        3      4      3       2           2        |
|o5 = 24x  - 36x y - 29x y  - 10x*y  - 29y  - 30x z + 19x y*z - 29x*y z -     |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|        3       2 2         2      2 2        3        3      4              |
|     24y z + 19x z  - 8x*y*z  - 38y z  - 22x*z  - 16y*z  + 39z               |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : K' = eulerMF g                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|      4      4      4                                                        |
|o6 = R  <-- R  <-- R                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : K'.dd                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|          4                                                                  |
|o7 = 1 : R  <----------------------------------------------------------------|
|               | -25z 0                                                      |
|               | 0    -25z                                                   |
|               | -25y -5x3-7x2y+43xy2-10y3+11x2z+38xyz-29y2z+38xz2-8yz2-22z3 |
|               | -25x 36x3-43x2y+30xy2+15y3-19x2z-43xyz-29y2z+8xz2-25yz2+16z3|
|                                                                             |
|          4                                                                  |
|     0 : R  <----------------------------------------------------------------|
|               | -30x3+19x2y-29xy2-24y3+38x2z-16xyz+25y2z+35xz2-48yz2-46z3 0 |
|               | 0                                                         -3|
|               | -25y                                                      -5|
|               | -25x                                                      36|
|                                                                             |
|o7 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| -36x3+43x2y-30xy2-15y3+19x2z+43xyz+29y2z-8xz2+25yz2-16z3 -5x3-7x2y+43xy2-10y|
| -25x                                                     25y                |
| 30x3-19x2y+29xy2+24y3-38x2z+16xyz-25y2z-35xz2+48yz2+46z3 0                  |
| 0                                                        30x3-19x2y+29xy2+24|
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                        -36x3+43x2y-30xy2-15y|
|0x3+19x2y-29xy2-24y3+38x2z-16xyz+25y2z+35xz2-48yz2-46z3 -25x                 |
|x3-7x2y+43xy2-10y3+11x2z+38xyz-29y2z+38xz2-8yz2-22z3    25z                  |
|x3-43x2y+30xy2+15y3-19x2z-43xyz-29y2z+8xz2-25yz2+16z3   0                    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                           4                                 |
|----------------------------------------- R  : 0                             |
|3+11x2z+38xyz-29y2z+38xz2-8yz2-22z3   |                                      |
|                                      |                                      |
|                                      |                                      |
|y3-38x2z+16xyz-25y2z-35xz2+48yz2+46z3 |                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|3+19x2z+43xyz+29y2z-8xz2+25yz2-16z3 -5x3-7x2y+43xy2-10y3+11x2z+38xyz-29y2z+38|
|                                    25y                                      |
|                                    0                                        |
