gradedModule(ZZdFactorization) -- a new ZZ/d-graded factorization in which the differential is zero
***************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note gradedModule: (Macaulay2Doc)gradedModule,
  * Usage: 
        gradedModule C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, whose
        differential is the zero map

Description
===========

This routine isolates the terms in the factorization and forgets the
differentials

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a,b,c]/(a^3+b^3+c^3);                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = tailMF ideal vars R                                      |
|                                                                  |
|       ZZ       4       ZZ       4       ZZ       4               |
|o2 = (---[a..c])  <-- (---[a..c])  <-- (---[a..c])                |
|      101              101              101                       |
|                                                                  |
|     0                1                0                          |
|                                                                  |
|o2 : ZZdFactorization                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : dd^C                                                         |
|                                                                  |
|           ZZ       4                             ZZ       4      |
|o3 = 1 : (---[a..c])  <------------------------ (---[a..c])  : 0  |
|          101            {5} | -a -c2 b2 0  |    101              |
|                         {5} | -c a2  0  b2 |                     |
|                         {5} | b  0   a2 c2 |                     |
|                         {6} | 0  -b  -c a  |                     |
|                                                                  |
|           ZZ       4                               ZZ       4    |
|     0 : (---[a..c])  <-------------------------- (---[a..c])  : 1|
|          101            {3} | -a2 -c2 b2 0   |    101            |
|                         {4} | -c  a   0  -b2 |                   |
|                         {4} | b   0   a  -c2 |                   |
|                         {4} | 0   b   c  a2  |                   |
|                                                                  |
|o3 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : G = gradedModule C                                           |
|                                                                  |
|       ZZ       4       ZZ       4       ZZ       4               |
|o4 = (---[a..c])  <-- (---[a..c])  <-- (---[a..c])                |
|      101              101              101                       |
|                                                                  |
|     0                1                0                          |
|                                                                  |
|o4 : ZZdFactorization                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : dd^G                                                         |
|                                                                  |
|o5 = 0                                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o5 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : dd^G == 0                                                    |
|                                                                  |
|o6 = true                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : assert((isdFactorization G)_0)                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : assert(G != C)                                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : assert(HH G == G)                                            |
