|                                                                             |
|      2      2      2                                                        |
|o4 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D = tailMF (m^2)                                                        |
