homomorphism'(ZZdFactorizationMap) -- get the element of Hom from a map of factorizations
*****************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note homomorphism': (Macaulay2Doc)homomorphism',
  * Usage: 
        f = homomorphism g
  * Inputs:
      * g, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,,
        from $C$ to $D$
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note DegreeLimit: (Macaulay2Doc)homomorphism', => ..., default value
        null,
      * *note MinimalGenerators: (Macaulay2Doc)homomorphism', => ..., default
        value true,
      * *note Strategy: (Macaulay2Doc)homomorphism', => ..., default value
        null,
  * Outputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, a
        map of the form $f : R^1 \to Hom(C, D)$, where $R$ is the underlying
        ring of these factorizations

Description
===========

As a first example, consider two matrix factorizations $C$ and $D$. From a
random map $f : R^1 \to Hom(C, D)$, we construct the corresponding map of
ZZ/d-graded factorizations $g : C \to D$.

+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a,b];                                     |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = S/(a^3+b^3);                                     |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : m = ideal vars R                                     |
|                                                          |
|o3 = ideal (a, b)                                         |
