id _ ZZdFactorization -- the identity map of a ZZ/d-graded factorization
************************************************************************

  * Scripted functor: *note id: (Macaulay2Doc)id,
  * Usage: 
        f = id_C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 
  * Outputs:
