|                                                                             |
|o3 = ideal (a, b)                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = tailMF m                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|      2      2      2                                                        |
|o4 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D = tailMF (m^2)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|      3      3      3                                                        |
|o5 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f = randomFactorizationMap(D, C, Cycle => true, InternalDegree => 2)    |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                      2                           |
|o6 = 0 : S  <---------------------------------- S  : 0                       |
|               {3} | 20a+29b 24a2-17ab+9b2  |                                |
|               {3} | 10a-19b 30a2-48ab-7b2  |                                |
|               {3} | 32a-36b 19a2-11ab-21b2 |                                |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                2                                 |
|     1 : S  <---------------------------- S  : 1                             |
|               {5} | 20a+21b 24a-36b  |                                      |
|               {5} | -10a+9b -30a-29b |                                      |
|               {5} | 32a-7b  19a+19b  |                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isWellDefined image f                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : potential image f                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|      3    3                                                                 |
|o8 = a  + b                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
