|               {3} | 10a-19b 30a2-48ab-7b2  |                                |
|               {3} | 32a-36b 19a2-11ab-21b2 |                                |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                                                  |
|     1 : S  <---------------------------- image {5} |                        |
|               {5} | 20a+21b 24a-36b  |         {5} |                        |
|               {5} | -10a+9b -30a-29b |         {5} |                        |
|               {5} | 32a-7b  19a+19b  |                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{3} | 20a+29b 24a2-17ab+9b2  | : 0                                           |
