isCommutative(ZZdFactorizationMap) -- whether a ZZ/d-graded factorization map commutes with the differentials
*************************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isCommutative: (Macaulay2Doc)isCommutative,
  * Usage: 
        isCommutative f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, that is true when $f$
        commutes with the differentials

Description
===========

For a ZZ/d-graded factorization map $f : C \to D$ of degree $d$, this method
checks whether, for all $i$, we have $dd^D_{i+d} * f_i =  (f_{i-1} * dd^C_i)$.

