isFactorizationMorphism(ZZdFactorizationMap) -- whether a ZZdFactorizationMap is a morphism of factorizations
*************************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isFactorizationMorphism:
    isFactorizationMorphism_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp,
  * Usage: 
        isFactorizationMorphism f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, that is true when $f$
        commutes with the differentials and has degree $0$

Description
===========

For a factorization map $f : C \to D$ of degree $d$, this method checks whether
$d = 0$ and, for all $i$, we have $dd^D_{i+d} * f_i = (-1)^d * (f_{i-1} *
dd^C_i)$.

