|o7 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                        |
|                                                            |
|     0      1      0                                        |
|                                                            |
|o7 : ZZdFactorization                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : D.dd                                                   |
|                                                            |
|          2                                 2               |
|o8 = 1 : S  <----------------------------- S  : 0           |
|               {1} | -26b2 a2-3ab+32b2 |                    |
|               {2} | a+3b  3a+8b       |                    |
