|i2 : R = S/(a^2+b^2+c^2);                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : m = ideal vars R                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = ideal (a, b, c)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
