koszulMF -- Construct a Koszul matrix factorization from an ideal and a polynomial
**********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        koszulMF(List, RingElement)
  * Inputs:
      * List, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, A list of ring elements or an
        ideal I
      * RingElement, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, A
        polynomial element
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 

Description
===========

Constructs a Koszul matrix factorization from a list and a polynomial, where
the factorization is built by writing the ring element as a linear combination
of the ring elements in the list. If the list is instead and ideal, then the
factorization is built with respect to a generating set of the ideal. If no
list or ring is specified, then the command constructs the factorization with
respect the the homogeneous maximal ideal.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
