|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x^2*y, y^3*z)                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|             2    3                                                          |
|o2 = ideal (x y, y z)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = x^2*y + y^3*z                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|      3     2                                                                |
|o3 = y z + x y                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : R                                                                       |
