+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x*y^2*z^3 + x^3*y*z^2                                               |
|                                                                             |
|      3   2      2 3                                                         |
|o2 = x y*z  + x*y z                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Q                                                                       |
