=====================

  * "linearMF(RingElement)"
  * "linearMF(RingElement,RingElement)"
  * "linearMF(RingElement,Symbol)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note linearMF: linearMF, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

