  * *note isFactorizationMorphism(ZZdFactorizationMap):
    isFactorizationMorphism_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- whether a
    ZZdFactorizationMap is a morphism of factorizations
  * *note isNullHomotopic(ZZdFactorizationMap):
    isNullHomotopic_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- whether a map of ZZ/d-graded
    factorizations is null-homotopic

Elementary operations on factorization maps
===========================================

