  * *note ZZdFactorizationMap _ Array: ZZdFactorizationMap ^ Array, -- the
    composition with the canonical inclusion or projection map
  * *note ZZdFactorizationMap ^ Array: ZZdFactorizationMap ^ Array, -- the
