monomialMF -- Construct a trivial d-fold factorization of a monomial
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        monomialMF(RingElement)
  * Inputs:
      * RingElement, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, A
        monomial in some polynomial ring
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 

Description
===========

Constructs a trivial d-fold factorization of a degree d monomial, which is
given by multiplying all variables of the monomial.

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[x..z]                                |
|                                                 |
|o1 = Q                                           |
|                                                 |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                              |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x*y^2*z^3                               |
|                                                 |
|        2 3                                      |
|o2 = x*y z                                       |
|                                                 |
|o2 : Q                                           |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : degree f                                    |
|                                                 |
|o3 = {6}                                         |
|                                                 |
|o3 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = monomialMF(f)                           |
|                                                 |
|      1      1      1      1      1      1      1|
|o4 = Q  <-- Q  <-- Q  <-- Q  <-- Q  <-- Q  <-- Q |
|                                                 |
|     0      1      2      3      4      5      0 |
|                                                 |
|o4 : ZZdFactorization                            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isdFactorization C                          |
|                                                 |
|               2 3                               |
|o5 = (true, x*y z )                              |
|                                                 |
|o5 : Sequence                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------+
