    factorizations, -- information about the basic constructors
  * *note isNullHomotopic(ZZdFactorizationMap):
    isNullHomotopic_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- whether a map of ZZ/d-graded
    factorizations is null-homotopic
  * *note isNullHomotopyOf(ZZdFactorizationMap,ZZdFactorizationMap):
    isNullHomotopyOf_lpZZdFactorizationMap_cmZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- whether
    the first map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations is a null homotopy for the
    second
  * *note randomFactorizationMap: randomFactorizationMap, -- a random map of
    ZZ/d-graded factorizations
