|i2 : f = a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2                                     |
|                                                             |
|      2    2    2    2                                       |
|o2 = a  + b  + c  + d                                        |
|                                                             |
|o2 : Q                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C = linearMF(f)                                         |
|                                                             |
|      8      8      8                                        |
|o3 = Q  <-- Q  <-- Q                                         |
|                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                         |
|                                                             |
|o3 : ZZdFactorization                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : potential C                                             |
|                                                             |
|      2    2    2    2                                       |
|o4 = a  + b  + c  + d                                        |
|                                                             |
|o4 : Q                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : S = ZZ/101[a,b]                                         |
|                                                             |
|o5 = S                                                       |
|                                                             |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : D = randomTailMF(a^3 + b^3, 2, 6, 3)                    |
|                                                             |
|      5      5      5                                        |
|o6 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                         |
|                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                         |
|                                                             |
|o6 : ZZdFactorization                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : D.dd                                                    |
|                                                             |
|          5                                 5                |
|o7 = 1 : S  <----------------------------- S  : 0            |
|               {1} | -a2 b2 0   0   0  |                     |
|               {1} | 0   0  -a2 b2  ab |                     |
|               {1} | 0   0  -ab -a2 b2 |                     |
|               {1} | 0   0  b2  ab  a2 |                     |
|               {2} | b   a  0   0   0  |                     |
|                                                             |
|          5                         5                        |
|     0 : S  <--------------------- S  : 1                    |
|               | -a 0  0  0 b2 |                             |
|               | b  0  0  0 a2 |                             |
|               | 0  -a 0  b 0  |                             |
|               | 0  b  -a 0 0  |                             |
|               | 0  0  b  a 0  |                             |
|                                                             |
|o7 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                     |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : D.dd^2                                                  |
|                                                             |
|          5                                         5        |
|o8 = 0 : S  <------------------------------------- S  : 0    |
|               | a3+b3 0     0     0     0     |             |
|               | 0     a3+b3 0     0     0     |             |
|               | 0     0     a3+b3 0     0     |             |
|               | 0     0     0     a3+b3 0     |             |
|               | 0     0     0     0     a3+b3 |             |
|                                                             |
|          5                                             5    |
|     1 : S  <----------------------------------------- S  : 1|
|               {1} | a3+b3 0     0     0     0     |         |
|               {1} | 0     a3+b3 0     0     0     |         |
|               {1} | 0     0     a3+b3 0     0     |         |
|               {1} | 0     0     0     a3+b3 0     |         |
|               {2} | 0     0     0     0     a3+b3 |         |
