Preprogrammed examples and operations -- Information about the basic constructors
*********************************************************************************

Basic constructors
==================

  * *note ZZdfactorization(HashTable): ZZdfactorization_lpHashTable_rp, -- make
    a ZZ/d-graded factorization
  * *note ZZdfactorization(List): ZZdfactorization, -- make a ZZ/d-graded
    factorization
  * *note isWellDefined(ZZdFactorization): isWellDefined_lpZZdFactorization_rp,
    -- whether a ZZ/d-graded factorization is well-defined
  * *note isdFactorization(ZZdFactorization): isdFactorization, -- Checks if
    the differentials of a factorization compose to a scalar multiple of the
    identity

Important constructors for creating ZZ/d-graded factorizations
==============================================================

  * *note koszulMF(List,RingElement): koszulMF, -- Construct a Koszul matrix
    factorization from an ideal and a polynomial
  * *note linearMF(RingElement): linearMF, -- Constructs a Koszul d-fold
    factorization of a homogeneous element of degree d
  * *note randomLinearMF(ZZ,Ring): randomLinearMF, -- Generates a linear d-fold
    factorization of a random degree d polynomial
  * *note tailMF(Module): tailMF, -- Generate a ZZdFactorization from a module
    over a hypersurface ring
  * *note randomTailMF(RingElement): randomTailMF, -- Construct a matrix
    factorization from a high syzygy of a random module over a hypersurface
  * *note gradedModule(ZZdFactorization): gradedModule_lpZZdFactorization_rp,
    -- a new ZZ/d-graded factorization in which the differential is zero
  * *note HH ZZdFactorization: HH ZZdFactorization, -- homology of a
    ZZ/d-graded factorization

More advanced constructors
==========================

  * *note ZZdFactorization ++ ZZdFactorization:
    directSum_lpZZdFactorization_rp, -- direct sum of ZZ/d-graded
    factorizations
  * *note ZZdFactorization ** ZZdFactorization: ZZdFactorization _st_st
    ZZdFactorization, -- tensor product of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note Hom(ZZdFactorization,ZZdFactorization):
    Hom_lpZZdFactorization_cmZZdFactorization_rp, -- the ZZ/d-graded
    homomorphism factorization between two ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note dual(ZZdFactorization): dual_lpZZdFactorization_rp, -- make the dual
    of a ZZ/d-graded factorization
  * *note RingMap ZZdFactorization: RingMap ZZdFactorization, -- apply a ring
    map
  * *note RingMap ** ZZdFactorization: RingMap _st_st ZZdFactorization, --
    tensor a ZZ/d-graded factorization along a ring map
  * *note minimalPresentation(ZZdFactorization):
    minimalPresentation_lpZZdFactorization_rp, -- minimal presentation of all
    terms in a ZZ/d-graded factorization

Extracting ZZ/d-graded factorization from ZZ/d-graded factorization maps
========================================================================

  * *note source(ZZdFactorizationMap): source_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- get
    the source of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note target(ZZdFactorizationMap): target_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- get
    the target of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note kernel(ZZdFactorizationMap): kernel_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- make
    the kernel of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note cokernel(ZZdFactorizationMap): cokernel_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, --
    make the cokernel of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note image(ZZdFactorizationMap): image_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- make
    the image of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note coimage(ZZdFactorizationMap): coimage_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, --
    make the coimage of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations
  * *note cone(ZZdFactorizationMap): cone_lpZZdFactorizationMap_rp, -- make the
    mapping cone of a morphism of ZZ/d-graded factorizations

