|                          | 0   1  0       0    0    0   |                   |
|                          | -a  -b -abt-ab 0    -a2  -b2 |                   |
|                          | -bt 0  b2t+b2  -a   ab   -a2 |                   |
|                          | 0   -a -a2     bt+b -b2t abt |                   |
