|2                                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : D = koszulMF(a^3+b^3+c^3)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|      4      4      4                                                        |
|o8 = Q  <-- Q  <-- Q                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : D.dd                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|          4                        4                                         |
|o9 = 1 : Q  <-------------------- Q  : 0                                     |
|               | c2 0  b  a   |                                              |
|               | 0  c2 a2 -b2 |                                              |
|               | b2 a  -c 0   |                                              |
|               | a2 -b 0  -c  |                                              |
|                                                                             |
|          4                         4                                        |
|     0 : Q  <--------------------- Q  : 1                                    |
|               | c  0  b   a   |                                             |
|               | 0  c  a2  -b2 |                                             |
|               | b2 a  -c2 0   |                                             |
|               | a2 -b 0   -c2 |                                             |
|                                                                             |
