|i10 : g = projectiveCover D                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|           4                                 8                               |
|o10 = 0 : Q  <----------------------------- Q  : 0                           |
|                | 1 0 0 0 c  0  b   a   |                                    |
|                | 0 1 0 0 0  c  a2  -b2 |                                    |
|                | 0 0 1 0 b2 a  -c2 0   |                                    |
|                | 0 0 0 1 a2 -b 0   -c2 |                                    |
