randomLinearMF -- Generates a linear d-fold factorization of a random degree d polynomial
*****************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        randomLinearMF(ZZ, Ring)
  * Inputs:
      * ZZ, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, An integer representing the
        degree
      * Ring, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, The ring object
      * RingElement, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, An
        element in the ring
      * Symbol, a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,, A symbol representing
        the indeterminate
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, 

Description
===========

Generates a linear d-fold factorization of a random degree $d$ polynomial using
the *note linearMF: linearMF, command. If the ring has too many variables the
output may be a factorization that is too large to be useful.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[x,y,z];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : d = 3;                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = randomLinearMF(d, Q, t) --way too many terms!                       |
|                                                                             |
|     /   Q[t]   \19683     /   Q[t]   \19683     /   Q[t]   \19683           |
|o3 = |----------|      <-- |----------|      <-- |----------|      <--       |
|     | 2        |          | 2        |          | 2        |                |
|     \t  + t + 1/          \t  + t + 1/          \t  + t + 1/                |
|                                                                             |
|     0                     1                     2                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|/   Q[t]   \19683                                                            |
||----------|                                                                 |
|| 2        |                                                                 |
|\t  + t + 1/                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|0                                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S = QQ[x,y]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : K' = randomLinearMF(d, S, t)                                            |
|                                                                             |
|     /   S[t]   \27     /   S[t]   \27     /   S[t]   \27     /   S[t]   \27 |
|o5 = |----------|   <-- |----------|   <-- |----------|   <-- |----------|   |
|     | 2        |       | 2        |       | 2        |       | 2        |   |
|     \t  + t + 1/       \t  + t + 1/       \t  + t + 1/       \t  + t + 1/   |
|                                                                             |
|     0                  1                  2                  0              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isdFactorization K'                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|            6 3     2    5   2   2 3                                         |
|o6 = (true, -x  + 6x y + -x*y  + -y )                                        |
|            7            4       9                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Sequence                                                                |
