ring(ZZdFactorization) -- access the ring of a ZZ/d-graded factorization or a factorization map
***********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)ring,
  * Usage: 
        ring C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, or a *note
        ZZdFactorizationMap: ZZdFactorizationMap,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 

Description
===========

Every ZZ/d-graded factorization or factorization map has a base ring.  This
function accesses that information.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a,b,c,d];                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = koszulMF({a,b,c,d}, a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2)     |
|                                                  |
|      8      8      8                             |
|o2 = S  <-- S  <-- S                              |
|                                                  |
|     0      1      0                              |
|                                                  |
|o2 : ZZdFactorization                             |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C.dd                                         |
|                                                  |
|          8                                  8    |
|o3 = 1 : S  <------------------------------ S  : 0|
|               | d 0  0  0  c  0  b  a  |         |
|               | 0 d  0  0  0  c  a  -b |         |
|               | 0 0  d  0  b  a  -c 0  |         |
|               | 0 0  0  d  a  -b 0  -c |         |
|               | c 0  b  a  -d 0  0  0  |         |
|               | 0 c  a  -b 0  -d 0  0  |         |
|               | b a  -c 0  0  0  -d 0  |         |
|               | a -b 0  -c 0  0  0  -d |         |
|                                                  |
|          8                                  8    |
|     0 : S  <------------------------------ S  : 1|
|               | d 0  0  0  c  0  b  a  |         |
|               | 0 d  0  0  0  c  a  -b |         |
|               | 0 0  d  0  b  a  -c 0  |         |
|               | 0 0  0  d  a  -b 0  -c |         |
|               | c 0  b  a  -d 0  0  0  |         |
|               | 0 c  a  -b 0  -d 0  0  |         |
|               | b a  -c 0  0  0  -d 0  |         |
|               | a -b 0  -c 0  0  0  -d |         |
|                                                  |
|o3 : ZZdFactorizationMap                          |
+--------------------------------------------------+
