RingMap ** ZZdFactorizationMap -- tensor a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations along a ring map
*********************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        phi ** f
        tensor(phi, f)
        S ** f
        f ** S
  * Inputs:
      * phi, a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, whose source is a ring
        $R$, and whose target is a ring $S$
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,,
        over the ring $R$
  * Outputs:
      * a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, over
        the ring $S$

Description
===========

These methods implement the base change of rings.  As input, one can either
give a ring map $\phi$, or the ring $S$ (when there is a canonical map from $R$
to $S$).

We illustrate the tensor product of a map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations along a
ring map.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = QQ[s,t]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : phi = map(S, R, {s, s+t, t})                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = map (S, R, {s, s + t, t})                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : RingMap S <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Rf = R/(x^3+y^3+z^3)                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Rf                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C = tailMF ideal vars Rf                                                |
|                                                                             |
|      4      4      4                                                        |
|o5 = R  <-- R  <-- R                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : D = phi ** C                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|      4      4      4                                                        |
|o6 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ZZdFactorization                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isdFactorization D                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|              3     2        2     3                                         |
|o7 = (true, 2s  + 3s t + 3s*t  + 2t )                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : phi(potential C) == potential D                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : dd^D                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|          4                                            4                     |
|o9 = 1 : S  <---------------------------------------- S  : 0                 |
|               {5} | -s  -t2  s2+2st+t2 0         |                          |
|               {5} | -t  s2   0         s2+2st+t2 |                          |
|               {5} | s+t 0    s2        t2        |                          |
|               {6} | 0   -s-t -t        s         |                          |
|                                                                             |
|          4                                            4                     |
|     0 : S  <---------------------------------------- S  : 1                 |
|               {3} | -s2 -t2 s2+2st+t2 0          |                          |
|               {4} | -t  s   0         -s2-2st-t2 |                          |
|               {4} | s+t 0   s         -t2        |                          |
|               {4} | 0   s+t t         s2         |                          |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : ZZdFactorizationMap                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : f = randomFactorizationMap(C, C)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|           4                                                               4 |
|o10 = 0 : R  <----------------------------------------------------------- R  |
|                {3} | 9/2 9/4x+3/4y+7/4z 7/3x+7y+3/7z 2/9x+3/10y+3/7z |      |
|                {4} | 0   7/9            6/7          5               |      |
|                {4} | 0   7/10           6            10/9            |      |
|                {4} | 0   7/10           5/4          10              |      |
|                                                                             |
|           4                                           4                     |
