rk1MCM2gen -- Construct every possible rank 1, 2-generated maximal Cohen-Macaulay module over the cubic Fermat hypersurface in 4 variables
******************************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        rk1MCM2gen(L,d)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, any permutation of the set
        {2,3,4}
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, any integer specifying the
        characteristic of the ambient field
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, A matrix
        factorization corresponding to a rank 1, 2-generated maximal
        Cohen-Macaulay module over the cubic Fermat hypersurface in 4
        variables.

Description
===========

This method constructs every possible rank 1, 2-generated maximal
Cohen-Macaulay module (up to isomorphism) over the cubic Fermat hypersurface in
4 variables. It is known that such MCM modules are parametrized by all
permutations of $\{ 2, 3 ,4 \}$.

