ZZdFactorization ** Matrix -- create the tensor product of a ZZ/d-graded factorization and a map of modules
***********************************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        h = C ** f
        h = f ** C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note ZZ/d graded factorization: ZZdFactorization,, over a ring
        $R$
      * f, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, defining a homomorphism from
        the $R$-module $M$ to the $R$-module $N$
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,,
        from $C \otimes M$ to $C \otimes N$

Description
===========

For any ZZ/d-graded factorization map $C$, a map $f \colon M \to N$ of
$R$-modules induces a morphism $C \otimes f$ of ZZ/d-graded factorizations from
$C \otimes M$ to $C \otimes N$.  This method returns this map of
factorizations.

