ZZdFactorizationMap ++ ZZdFactorizationMap -- direct sum of ZZ/d-graded factorization maps
******************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ++: (Macaulay2Doc)++,
  * Usage: 
        h = f ++ g
        h = directSum(f,g,...)
        h = directSum(name1 => f, name2 => g, ...)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
      * g, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,,
        that is the direct sum of the input ZZ/d-graded factorization maps

Description
===========

The direct sum of two ZZ/d-graded factorization maps is a a ZZ/d-graded
factorization map from the direct sum of the sources to the direct sum of the
targets.

