|                                                                            |
|o3 = ideal (a, b)                                                           |
|                                                                            |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : use S;                                                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C1 = tailMF m                                                          |
|                                                                            |
|      2      2      2                                                       |
|o5 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                        |
|                                                                            |
|     0      1      0                                                        |
|                                                                            |
|o5 : ZZdFactorization                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : C2 = randomTailMF(a^3+b^3, 3, 5, 2)                                    |
|                                                                            |
|      5      5      5                                                       |
|o6 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                        |
|                                                                            |
|     0      1      0                                                        |
|                                                                            |
|o6 : ZZdFactorization                                                       |
