|o14 = true                       |
+---------------------------------+
|i15 : h^[1] == (D1 ++ D2)^[1] * h|
|                                 |
|o15 = true                       |
+---------------------------------+

These can be combined to obtain the blocks of the map of chain complexes.

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : h_[0]^[0] == f                                     |
