ZZdFactorizationMap _ ZZ -- access individual matrices in a ZZ/d-graded factorization map
*****************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        f_i
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of ZZ/d-graded factorizations: ZZdFactorizationMap,, 
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the homological index
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the i-th map

Description
===========

A ZZ/d-graded factorization map $f : C \to D$ of degree $d$ is a sequence of
maps $f_i : C_i \to D_{i+d}$. This method allows one to access the individual
$f_i$.

